     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Requests and pharmacy recommendations",
     "texto": [
      "**Xarope para a tosse** = cough syrup.",
      "**Tosse** = cough. **Febre** = fever.",
      "**Tome uma colher…** = take a spoonful… (from the verb *tomar*).",
      "**Depois do jantar** = after dinner.",
      "**Se a febre continuar…** = if the fever continues, go to the doctor or contact the health centre."
     ],
